# Artifact chunks are gzipped JSON Lines and are large: the full run is 3.7 GB across 441 files, with the
# biggest single chunk at 13 MB. They are not committed at all — see .gitignore — because generation is a
# pure function of the profile, so the bytes are recoverable and the history cost is not.
*.jsonl.gz binary

# Everything else is text and should diff normally.
*.json text
*.md text
*.cs text
